*> vybe-test: cobol/display_advanced/test_display_group
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_display_advanced.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GROUP.
   05 WS-A PIC X(3) VALUE "123".
   05 WS-B PIC X(3) VALUE "456".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY WS-GROUP.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-GROUP DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "123456"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [123456] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

